#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:19
msgid "Open every square without a mine. A number tells how many of the eight squares around it hide mines. The first square you open is always safe. Three sizes; best times are kept."
msgstr "打開每個沒有地雷的方格。一個數字顯示它周圍的八個方格中有多少個埋有地雷。你打開的第一個方塊總是安全的。三種尺寸；最好的時光被保留。"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:20
msgid "click opens  ·  right-click flags  ·  click a number with its flags placed to open around it  ·  arrows, Space, F"
msgstr "點選開啟 · 右鍵點選標誌 · 點選一個數字及其周圍放置的標誌以開啟 · 箭頭、空格、F"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:22
#: config/apps/io.github.lyricat.Inua.SpacePinball.desktop:3
msgid "Space Pinball"
msgstr "太空彈珠"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:23
msgid "Fly missions to climb the ranks, from Cadet to Fleet Admiral. Hit the three yellow mission targets to light a mission, then shoot the launch ramp (right) to accept it; the display shows what to shoot and the time left. Missions burn fuel: roll through the inlanes and the re-entry lanes to refuel. The hyperspace ramp (left) climbs five levels, lighting an extra ball at the third and paying a jackpot at the fifth. The booster bank lights Lock: lock two balls in the black hole for multiball, where the launch ramp is the jackpot. The wormhole lets the ball out of the black hole. Light all three re-entry lanes to raise the field multiplier. The plunger's pull picks the lane a launch drops into: hit the blinking one for the skill shot. Nudge to save a ball, but not too often: the table tilts. Three balls; your best score is kept."
msgstr "執行飛行任務以提升軍銜，從學員到海軍上將。擊中三個黃色任務目標即可點燃任務，然後射擊發射坡道（右）以接受任務；顯示器顯示要拍攝的內容和剩餘時間。任務燃燒燃料：穿過內航道和再入航道補充燃料。超空間坡道（左）爬升五層，在第三層額外點亮一個球，並在第五層支付大獎。助推器組燈鎖定：將兩個球鎖定在黑洞中以獲得多球，其中發射坡道就是大獎。蟲洞讓球離開黑洞。點亮所有三個重返通道以提高場倍增器。柱塞的拉力會選擇發射所進入的車道：擊中閃爍的車道即可進行技能射擊。輕推以保存球，但不要太頻繁：桌子會傾斜。三個球；您的最佳成績將被保留。"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:24
msgid "A or ← left flipper  ·  D or → right flipper  ·  hold Space to pull the plunger  ·  X . ↑ nudge  ·  M sound  ·  P pause  ·  N new game"
msgstr "A或←左鰭狀件·D或→右鰭狀件·保持空間以拉動柱塞·X。 ↑ 輕推·M 聲音·P 暫停·N 新遊戲"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:27
msgid "A property game for two to four players, people at the screen taking turns, people in a browser on the same network (set On the network: the lobby shows the link and its QR code) and computer players, on a ring of 80 squares with two branch roads (at a fork, chance picks the road), in Tokyo, New York, Shanghai or Rome: choose the city, the rounds, the starting money, your rivals and the rules (one die or two; building on a street the turn you buy it) before you start. The board is larger than the window: drag it, scroll, or use the arrow keys to look about; Home brings you back to your pawn. Roll the dice and walk the board; with two, a double rolls again and three in a row go to jail. Buy the streets, ferry piers and utilities you land on; rivals landing there pay you rent. Every street of yours your pawn passes or lands on may go up one level that turn (outlined on the board): house by house to four, then a hotel; owning a whole colour group doubles its bare rent and adds half to its built rents. Piers pay more the more of them you own; utilities charge by the dice. Passing Start pays $400. Taxes and fines fill the fountain, and whoever lands there takes it. Cards come from Chance and the card shops, where you may buy any of the three on offer; hold up to ten, and play any number in your turn, before you roll or after you move: Loaded Dice, Free Rent, Requisition, Pickpocket, Demolition, Building Permit, Turtle, Swap Places, Jail Pass, Tax Audit, Fair Shares and Sleeping Pill. A card played on a street takes the square in focus: click it on the board first. Who cannot pay sells buildings and property at half price, or is out. After the last round, or when one player is left, the most worth wins: cash, property and buildings. Keys: Space the main action, R roll, B buy, X pass, E end turn, J pay bail, H build on the square in focus, M the sound on or off, N a new game. The sound plays through pw-cat; without it the game is silent."
msgstr "一款二至四人的地產遊戲：螢幕前輪流操作的玩家、在同一網路中用瀏覽器加入的玩家（開啟「在網路上」：大廳會顯示連結及其 QR 碼）和電腦玩家，在一個有兩條岔路的 80 格環形棋盤上（遇到岔路時由運氣選路），以東京、紐約、上海或羅馬為舞台：開始前選擇城市、回合數、初始資金、對手和規則（一顆骰子或兩顆；買下街道的當回合能否建造）。棋盤比視窗大：拖曳、捲動或用方向鍵四處查看；按 Home 回到你的棋子。擲骰子在棋盤上前進；用兩顆骰子時，擲出對子再擲一次，連續三次則進監獄。買下你停留的街道、渡輪碼頭和公用事業；對手停在那裡要向你付租金。你的棋子經過或停留的每條你的街道，當回合都可以升一級（在棋盤上框出）：一棟一棟蓋房子到四棟，然後是飯店；擁有整個顏色組時，空地租金翻倍，有建築的租金增加一半。碼頭擁有得越多收得越多；公用事業按骰子點數收費。經過起點領取 $400。稅金和罰款匯入噴泉，誰停在那裡誰拿走。卡牌來自「機會」和卡牌商店，商店裡待售的三張可以任意購買；最多持有十張，在自己的回合裡擲骰前或移動後可以打出任意張：灌鉛骰子、免租、強制徵購、扒手、拆除、建築許可、烏龜、交換位置、出獄卡、稅務稽查、平分財富和安眠藥。作用於街道的卡牌針對選中的格子：先在棋盤上點擊它。付不起的人以半價出售建築和地產，否則出局。最後一回合結束後，或只剩一名玩家時，身價最高者獲勝：現金、地產和建築。按鍵：空白鍵 主要操作，R 擲骰，B 購買，X 放棄，E 結束回合，J 交保釋金，H 在選中的格子上建造，M 開關聲音，N 新遊戲。聲音透過 pw-cat 播放；沒有它遊戲就是靜音的。"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:28
msgid "Space the main action  ·  R roll  ·  B buy  ·  X pass  ·  E end turn  ·  J pay bail  ·  H build on the square in focus  ·  N new game  ·  M sound  ·  click a square to see it  ·  drag, scroll or arrows to look about  ·  Home your pawn"
msgstr "空白鍵 主要操作  ·  R 擲骰  ·  B 購買  ·  X 放棄  ·  E 結束回合  ·  J 交保釋金  ·  H 在選中的格子上建造  ·  N 新遊戲  ·  M 聲音  ·  點擊格子查看  ·  拖曳、捲動或方向鍵四處查看  ·  Home 回到你的棋子"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:31
msgid "Race your ten marbles from your point of the star to the point across. In your turn move one marble: a step into a neighbouring hole, or hops over a neighbouring marble (anyone's) into the empty hole beyond, as many in a row as you can. Marbles hopped over stay where they are. You are home when every hole of your goal is filled, some with your marbles. Two, three, four or six play: people at this screen, the computer at three levels, the AI, and people in a browser on the same network (set On the network: the setup shows the link and its QR code). Partners in a team win together when all of them are home, and a player home moves a partner's marbles. With Stay out of other points, a marble may cross another player's point but not stop in it. When no one plays at this screen, the first to join from a browser sets the game up and starts it."
msgstr "把你的十顆彈珠從星形棋盤的一個角跳到對面的角。每回合移動一顆彈珠：走一步到相鄰的空位，或跳過相鄰的彈珠（誰的都可以）落到後面的空位，能連跳幾次就跳幾次。被跳過的彈珠留在原地。目標角的每個洞都被填滿、且其中有你的彈珠時，就算到家。兩人、三人、四人或六人玩：這台電腦前的人、三個難度的電腦、AI，以及同一網路中瀏覽器裡的人（開啟「在網路上」：設定頁會顯示連結和 QR 碼）。同隊的隊友全部到家時一起獲勝，已到家的玩家可以替隊友走彈珠。開啟「不停在別人的角」後，彈珠可以穿過別人的角，但不能停在那裡。沒有人在這台電腦上玩時，第一個從瀏覽器加入的人設定並開始遊戲。"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:32
msgid "click one of your marbles, then where it goes  ·  Escape puts it back  ·  N new game"
msgstr "點一顆你的彈珠，再點它要去的位置  ·  Esc 放回  ·  N 新遊戲"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:35
msgid "The tables of a game lobby (inua-game-lobby) on the internet, as they change: the game at each, who plays, and the seats open. Join or Watch opens the table's game in the browser. A free table's buttons start Small Fortune or Chinese Checkers here, set to host at that table: set it up and start it, and others join it from the lobby. Give the lobby's address as its host gave it, with ?key=… when the lobby asks for a key to host."
