msgstr "還沒有已配對的裝置。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:644
msgid "The paired devices show while sharing is on."
msgstr "分享開啟時會顯示已配對的裝置。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:659
msgid "Paired twice, so it cannot connect: unpair each, then pair it again."
msgstr "重複配對，因此無法連線：請逐一取消配對，再重新配對。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:689
msgid "A PIN is four digits."
msgstr "PIN 是四位數字。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:701
msgid "That is not the PIN %s shows."
msgstr "這不是 %s 顯示的 PIN。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:703
msgid "%s was paired here before, as %s, and a device paired twice is refused. Its old pairing is removed: pair again from %s."
msgstr "%s 之前已在此配對，名稱為 %s，而重複配對的裝置會被拒絕。舊的配對已移除：請從 %s 重新配對。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:706
msgid "%s was not paired: %v"
msgstr "%s 未能配對：%v"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:727
msgid "%s was not unpaired: %v"
msgstr "%s 未能取消配對：%v"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:795
msgid "Connected: its desktop is in a window of its own."
msgstr "已連線：它的桌面在獨立的視窗中。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:798
msgid "It does not answer: it is off, or not sharing its desktop."
msgstr "沒有回應：它已關機，或沒有分享桌面。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:800
msgid "It shares with Nvidia's GameStream, which Remote Desktop does not speak."
msgstr "它透過 Nvidia 的 GameStream 分享，遠端桌面不支援。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:802
msgid "It has forgotten this computer: pair again."
msgstr "它已忘記這台電腦：請重新配對。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:804
msgid "Not paired: pair once, with a PIN typed on it."
msgstr "未配對：在它上面輸入 PIN，配對一次即可。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:806
msgid "Paired. Its desktop is being streamed; connecting joins in."
msgstr "已配對。它的桌面正在串流，連線即可加入。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:808
msgid "Paired, and ready."
msgstr "已配對，可以連線。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:846
msgid "On %s, open Remote Desktop → Sharing (or Sunshine's PIN page) and type:"
msgstr "在 %s 上開啟遠端桌面 → 分享（或 Sunshine 的 PIN 頁面），然後輸入："

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:869
msgid "Paired, but not saved, so not kept after this window: %v"
msgstr "已配對，但未儲存，關閉此視窗後不會保留：%v"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:873
msgid "The PIN typed there was not this one. Pair again."
msgstr "那邊輸入的 PIN 不是這個。請重新配對。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:875
msgid "%s took the PIN, then refused this computer: it had this computer paired already, perhaps under another name, and refuses a computer paired twice. If it shares with inua, it has removed the old pairing: pair again. Otherwise unpair this computer there first."
msgstr "%s 接受了 PIN，隨後拒絕了這台電腦：它已配對過這台電腦（可能用的是別的名稱），並會拒絕重複配對的電腦。如果對方以 inua 分享，它已移除舊的配對：請重新配對。否則請先在對方那邊取消這台電腦的配對。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:878
msgid "Pairing failed: %v"
msgstr "配對失敗：%v"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:893
msgid "Its session did not end: %v"
msgstr "它的工作階段未能結束：%v"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:906
msgid "Not forgotten: the list of machines was not saved: %v"
msgstr "未移除：機器清單未能儲存：%v"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:942
msgid "Nothing shares a desktop at %s: %v"
msgstr "%s 上沒有分享的桌面：%v"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:947
