msgid "This computer cannot decode it: choose another."
msgstr "這台電腦無法解碼：請選擇其他的。"

#: internal/remoteui/window.go:1015
msgid "Decoded by the processor here: slower than the graphics card."
msgstr "這裡由處理器解碼：比顯示卡慢。"

